    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just that \"resting\" doesn't feel like enough anymore. like, if nothing matters and we're just accidental biological machines on a rock that's gonna be gone in a few billion years... why is there such a huge pressure to keep dragging this machine along? it feels more like a sentence than a gift, you know?",
